[FICTIONAL EXAMPLE POSTING] Procurement Specialist | Example Trading Co. (fictional)
Duties: request and compare supplier quotes, follow up on contracts, keep the purchasing ledger.
Requirements:
1. Bachelor's degree or above;
2. 3+ years of procurement-related work experience;
3. Age 35 or under;
4. Proficient with office software.
Location: Shanghai (fictional)

[FICTIONAL EXAMPLE POSTING] Operations Manager | Example Web Technology Co. (fictional)
Duties: run the day-to-day operations of the online store, plan campaigns and follow the data.
Requirements:
1. Bachelor's degree or above;
2. 5+ years of operations-management experience;
3. Age generally not above 35; for candidates with an intermediate or higher professional title, or 8+ years of relevant industry experience, the age limit may be relaxed to 40;
4. Good communication and coordination skills.
Location: Hangzhou (fictional)

[FICTIONAL EXAMPLE POSTING] Administrative Assistant | Example Consulting Co. (fictional)
Duties: schedule meetings, file documents, receive visitors and give day-to-day administrative support.
Requirements:
1. Associate degree or above;
2. Administrative or secretarial experience preferred;
3. Under 30 preferred;
4. Careful and responsible.
Location: Chengdu (fictional)
